{"strongs": "H8181", "word": "שֵׂעָר", "translit": "se.ar", "root": "שער", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "hair", "definition": "שֵׂעָר 27 noun masculine Lev 13:3 hair ; — absolute ׳ שׂ Gen 25:25 +, construct שְׂעַר Judg 16:22 +, שַׂ֫עַר Isa 7:20 ( Ges «GKC:93hh»§ 93hh Kö ii. 1. 78 ); suffix שְׂעָרֵךְ Ezek 16:7 , שַׂעֲרֵךְ Song 4:1 ; Song 6:5 ( Kö l.c .); שְׂעָרוֺ Lev 14:8 +, שְׂעָרָהּ v Lev 14:20 , שְׂעָרָהֿ v Lev 14:4 ( Ges «GKC:91e»§ 91e ); — hair: 1. of animals, as material, ׳ אַדֶּרֶת שׂ Gen 25:5 ( J ), Zech 13:4 probably also ׳ אִישׁ בַּעַל שׂ 2Kgs 1:8 i.e. a man with a garment of skin. 2. human: ראֹשׁוֺ ׳ שׂ Judg 16:22 ; 2Sam 14:26 ; Num 6:5 ( P ), compare v Num 6:18 ( P ); + beard Ezra 9:3 ׳ קָדְקֹד שׂ Ps 68:22 including head, beard, eyebrows Lev 14:8 ; Lev 14:9 ; Lev 14:10 ( P ); הָרַגְלַיִם ׳ שׂ Isa 7:20 (i.e. of genitals; + ראֹשׁ , זָקָן ; in figure) long hair of woman Ezek 16:7 ; Song 4:1 ; Song 6:5 hair of skin in (leprosy-)marks Lev 13:3 + 10 t. 13 ( P ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8278')\">BDB8278</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8181')\">H8181</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8277')\">BDB8277</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8279')\">BDB8279</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שֵׂעָר</bdbheb><sub>27</sub> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Lev 13:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,3)\">Lev 13:3</ref></sup> <highlightword>hair</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׂ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 25:25\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(1,25,25)\">Gen 25:25</ref> +, construct <bdbheb>שְׂעַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 16:22\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,22)\">Judg 16:22</ref> +, <bdbheb>שַׂ֫עַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 7:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,20)\">Isa 7:20</re